# Semgrep ignore list for the continuous security lane.
#
# Semgrep's built-in default ignores `tests/`, `test/` and fixture directories.
# That default would silently hide the gate's own proof fixtures and every
# regression under `tests/`, so the repository defines its own list instead.
# Production exclusions live in `config/security-scanner-policy.json` and are
# passed as explicit `--exclude` flags.

.git/
node_modules/
dist/
coverage/
playwright-report/
test-results/
public/design/
